<title>JAPAN: Toyota April domestic output up 8.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Toyota April domestic output up 8.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp said on Thursday its domestic vehicle production rose 8.1 percent in April from a year earlier to 290,675 vehicles.  </p>
<p>Toyota's domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas output in April were as follows:</p>
<p>    Production	  290,675   up	8.1 percent</p>
<p>    Domestic sales    119,773   down   16.6 percent</p>
<p>    Exports	     118,423   up	1.8 percent</p>
<p>    Overseas output   131,362   up     12.4 percent</p>
</text>
